{"catch":"你或許不該出現在這裡。","desc":"你發現了一座廢棄的監獄。\n\n你自然而然地決定去探索一番。\n\n《鏽跡斑斑的監獄：恐怖》是一款令人毛骨悚然的探索遊戲，你將在一座被遺忘的、鏽跡斑斑的監獄中漫步，尋找一些有趣的東西。探索黑暗的牢房、詭異的房間、破敗的走廊，以及那些本該永遠緊閉的角落。","publisher":"Downmeadowstreet","release":"2026-09-24","genres":["冒險"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"size":"Switch 2 0.2GB / Switch 0.2GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/41bdcc035c57f1f6e7750cea31333210b61848c30bb991adb8275708a3f38b35.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d590d9ded2cafe28ff89a158f64e61e824f579bb8d827bfa9c9f7965d33e92b6.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/8ee5b3a7b3305deadde2d7c94e836628bf1be777041e298b2d83f8d736409bf1.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/de586d9508448b2011cba8a3c5d3d878c83f2c3fe1b49cb92c27106bbc59e09a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/51f4b6e453ea382f903abc95109ee73f6f1bd7a91cf15d4bc81ffbc738a51e7d.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c825c6b0e8f31d0adf4e8c71c807992032b23bcfd3d8616b32480bbeeb6f5132.jpg"]}